+  //  M / (8 or 4); Mr is 8 or 4
+  //  K / 8; K for smmla is 8
+  //  4,   ; 4 row-pairs for each 8 rows
+  //  2,   ; row-pair is 2 rows
+  //  4    ; 4 elements per row
